  "title": "Very Personal Bolognese Sauce",
  "description": "Worcestershire sauce and harissa give this bolognese sauce a unique tangy spicy flavor, and the mascarpone gives an incredibly creamy finish to the sauce. Serve over your favorite pasta sprinkled with Parmesan cheese.",
